---
layout: "base.webc"
title: "2019 Defibrillator Poem"
id: "20190401"
poemTitle: "Westmuir’s Defibrillator"
author: "Eila Webster"
endOfYear: false
---

<div class="full-width">
  <poem-grid
    class="wide-text"
    :title="poemTitle"
    :author="author"
    :theme="bgTheme"
  >
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <img
      src="/poems/2019-defibrillator-poem/image-8.avif"
      alt=""
      slot="header-tl"
    />

    <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-1-images">
      <img src="/poems/2019-defibrillator-poem/image-9.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-defibrillator-poem/image-4.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-defibrillator-poem/image-3.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <!-- Column 2 Text -->
    <div slot="col-2-text">
      <p>
        When Westmuir Defibrillator Group joined up, <br />
        With the Community Heartbeat Trust ; <br />
        In the old phone box at the Shoppie, <br />
        To give your support now is a MUST.
      </p>

      <p>
        Getting it up and running, <br />
        Would be a great day for us all; <br />
        If everyone gave their very best, <br />
        Whether it be large or small.
      </p>

      <p>
        Financial help is still needed, <br />
        And gifts of kind are welcome too; <br />
        Ideas to brighten up the site, <br />
        To make it fresh and new.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
    <div slot="col-3-images">
      <img src="/poems/2019-defibrillator-poem/image-7.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-defibrillator-poem/image-0.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-defibrillator-poem/image-1.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <!-- Column 4 Text -->
    <div slot="col-4-text">
      <p>
        No longer a sleepy village, <br />
        We could save a life you see; <br />
        Having the equipment here, <br />
        A great achievement you’ll agree.
      </p>

      <p>
        So throw your whole self in it, <br />
        Work on it with a smile; <br />
        I know you won’t regret it, <br />
        When you go that extra mile.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 5 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-5-images">
      <img src="/poems/2019-defibrillator-poem/image-5.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-defibrillator-poem/image-6.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-defibrillator-poem/image-2.avif" alt="" />
    </div>
  </poem-grid>
</div>
